# ASUS Zenbook Duo detachable keyboard: libinput treats its touchpad as an
# external device, which disables palm rejection while typing. Declare that the
# touchpad sits below the keys like a built-in one.
[ASUS Zenbook Duo Keyboard Touchpad]
MatchName=*ASUS Zenbook Duo Keyboard Touchpad
AttrTPKComboLayout=below
